// Title: CodePage Modification Via MODE.COM To Russian Language
// Rule ID: 12fbff88-16b5-4b42-9754-cd001a789fb3
// Severity: medium
// Tags: attack.defense-evasion, attack.t1036
// Category: process_creation
// Product: windows
// Pipeline: microsoft_xdr
// Source: /home/user/Sigma_KQL/sigma_rules/rules/windows/process_creation/proc_creation_win_mode_codepage_russian.yml
//
// Generated by sigma-to-kql converter
